B. K. S. Iyengar. Light on Yoga. English. The Schocken paperback edition listed by the publisher was published in 1995, ISBN 9780805210316.

[Publisher’s edition](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/85770/light-on-yoga-by-b-k-s-iyengar/). Obtain a library or owned copy. This modern work is copyrighted; no local book or illustrations are supplied.

The work discusses Yoga’s philosophy and presents illustrated postures and breathing exercises. Identify the edition, named section, and posture or exercise number when citing it; page numbers can differ. This source is distinct from Iyengar’s Light on the Yoga Sūtras of Patañjali.

